<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>Self-reporting analysis</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A1.F9.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.01524v1/figures/classifieds-difficulty.png" id="A1.F9.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/828;" width="548" height="828" alt="Refer to caption">
